{"unit_id":"FuWenLianggit__dsh-goal-auto#feature-1","repo":"FuWenLianggit/dsh-goal-auto","commit":"d9b76369395c0a03d1de9bcf9f6e3eb28775db34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@huanlin/dsh-goal-auto 的功能「会话自动续跑」：在会话标题栏切换该会话的启用状态，主机保存设置，并在启动时恢复已标记的会话、挂载预设并重新激活未完成目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:73-124","src/index.js:106-190","src/index.js:255-271"]}
